  "description": "Electric Cargo Pedicab Truck with a walled cargo bed\n\nThe Truck version carries its load in a cargo bed with high side walls, so boxes, crates, tools and loose items stay put while you ride. It's built for businesses that move goods around a city, a campus or a resort every day.\n\nWhat every Xion cargo pedicab has\n\nClass 2 e-bike drive: a 750W brushless motor and a 72V 58Ah lithium-ion battery, with throttle and pedal assist up to 20 mph. Zero tailpipe emissions.\n\nRemovable battery: up to 40 miles per charge and a full recharge in about 3 hours, at your depot or on the go.\n\nSimple controls: handlebar light switch and a digital display showing speed, battery level and trip distance.\n\nBuilt to be seen and to stop: bright LED headlight and disc brakes front and rear.\n\nAll-weather tires with a patterned tread for grip on mixed surfaces.\n\nSpecifications\n\nGood fit for\n\nLast-mile delivery: groceries, parcels, catering and supplies in dense downtowns.\n\nMaintenance and facilities crews: tools and materials across campuses, parks and resorts.\n\nEvents: moving gear, merchandise and supplies between stages and booths.\n\nNeed several?",
